---
description: Core rules for every Jext task
alwaysApply: true
---

- `AGENTS.md` in the repository root is the source of truth. Read it before the first change; do not copy its
  content into Cursor rules.
- Package specifics: `packages/<pkg>/AGENTS.md` and `packages/<pkg>/docs/en/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Answer the user in the language they write in. Code, comments, commit messages and agent files are English.
- Do not add runtime dependencies without an ADR.
